# PostHog — same project as tensr-platform-web (app.tensr.xyz).
# Copy both values from that Vercel project onto the tensr-web (www.tensr.xyz) project.
# The browser sends through the /ingest reverse proxy. NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST is the
# upstream ingest host (US cloud: https://us.i.posthog.com).
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_PROJECT_TOKEN=
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com
